# =====================================================================
#  DATA NEVER ENTERS GIT.  See DATA_POLICY.md.
#  This file is the first line of defence; scripts/check_no_data.py
#  (pre-commit + pre-push + CI) is the second.  Never use `git add -f`.
# =====================================================================

